#. Tag: para
#: using-setup.docbook:7
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&digikam; tries to give you as much control over how it works as possible. "
"There are many options that change the behavior of &digikam;. To access "
"these settings select <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Configure &digikam;</guimenuitem></menuchoice> from the "
"menubar. The configuration dialog is separated into 15 pages. You can change "
"between these pages by clicking on the icons on the left-hand side of the "
"dialog."
msgstr ""

